WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:03.837
I see the path to victory so certain.

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:08.467
I will take my
place as a conqueror…

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.761
a sorcerer…

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:13.889
a king.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:17.893
We have work to do.

00:00:20.479 --> 00:00:22.314
Sauron's victory is at hand.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:25.817
One ring…

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:28.904
to rule them all.

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:35.285
The enemy has twice our number.

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:40.541
Together I know
we can turn the tide.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:43.460
Kneel to him, Gandalf.

00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:48.882
Let the hunt begin.

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:57.766
How are we supposed to defeat
the Dark Lord on our own?

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.059
We won't be on our own.

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:04.106
I came to slay a god.

00:01:05.566 --> 00:01:07.651
There is something
you fear to tell me.

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:12.281
All of it has come to this.

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:18.370
We have no choice but to act.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.334
Why are you doing all of this?

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.305
This day we march together…

00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:40.684
to bring order…

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:43.687
to this broken world!

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:51.612
We are, all of us,
on the path to ruin now.

